- Cleaner India-only presentation with hover state labels
- Drag-to-pan, wheel/pinch zoom, Fit India, Compact and Maximize/Restore controls
- Collapsible site details panel
- Preserve map viewport during AJAX health refresh
- Settings page full-page refresh disabled correctly
- Runtime page full-page refresh disabled correctly
- New versioned CSS/JS asset names to avoid stale browser cache
